  "description": "Bigger features. Bigger jumps.\n\nThe DK Six Pack 24 brings the quality of the Six Pack into the larger wheeled cruiser ranks. The DK Six Pack got its name at the trails but feels right at home at the park or in the streets. The 4130 heat-treated chromoly main frame is pro-inspired with excellent geometry, upgraded with a strong double-walled wheelset, 100% sealed bearings throughout, and a chromoly crankset with a 26T aluminum sprocket delivering the durability you need for every session. The DK Six Pack is top-tier performance at a price that won't break the bank.\n\nCranks Wise tubular chromoly 3-piece, 170mm, 8-spline spindle\n\nSprocket DK Replica 26-tooth, Alloy\n\nChain KMC Z-510\n\nPedals DK Blender PC platform\n\nRims Wise Rectrix2, double wall, 36mm wide, 36-hole\n\nFront Hub Alloy, fully sealed, 3/8” chromoly axle\n\nRear Hub Alloy, fully sealed, 14mm chromoly axle, 10-tooth driver\n\nTires 24x2.1” Kenda, 65psi\n\nSeat DK 1-piece padded seat/post combo\n\nSeat Post Integrated, 25.4mm, alloy\n\nSeat Post Clamp Integrated\n\nExtra Features 3D head tube badge\n\nWeight 26.2 lbs",
